## Phase 5: Production Operational Deployment

Log back into your AWS server command-line terminal to input your secure credentials and automate the morning activation routines:

```bash
# Step 1: Move into the production folder layout
cd /home/ubuntu/dhan_momentum_bot

# Step 2: Open your config environment file to add real keys
nano config.env
# [INSTRUCTIONS: Paste your Client ID, API Keys, and 2FA TOTP Seed Key into this file. 
#  Press Ctrl+O followed by Enter to write changes out, then press Ctrl+X to exit nano]

# Step 3: Open the automated background OS cron engine scheduler
crontab -e
# [INSTRUCTIONS: If prompted, select '1' for the standard /bin/nano text interface]
```

Scroll all the way down to the blank line at the bottom of the crontab configuration layout page and paste this exact automated trigger entry line:

```text
00 06 * * 1-5 cd /home/ubuntu/dhan_momentum_bot && /usr/bin/python3 main.py >> /home/ubuntu/dhan_momentum_bot/execution_history.log 2>&1
```
*Save and close crontab (`Ctrl+O`, `Enter`, `Ctrl+X`). Your system is now fully automated to boot, authenticate at 6:00 AM, and trade at 9:46 AM Monday through Friday hands-free.*

